{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26211","headline":"陆丞相故宅 · 殷尧藩","name":"陆丞相故宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衣冠零落久，今日事堪伤。\n厨起青烟薄，门开白日长。\n残梅欹古道，名石卧颓墙。\n山色依然好，兴衰未可量。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷尧藩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26211.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26211","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}